+ * only when all of the block's register loads fit at once in a budget the
+ * preamble's registers can hold (the early preamble may only use the 32
+ * shared registers): hoisting the loads of a preamble that is short of
+ * registers anyway (matrix products) only adds spills and waits.
+ */
